    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19802" root="سعر" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِعْرٌ</span></b>  The <i>current price,</i> or <i>rate, at which a
thing is to be sold:</i> (MA, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْعَارٌ</span>. (S, A,
Msb, K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهُ سِعْرٌ</span>, meaning <i>It is exceedingly valuable:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْسَ لَهُ سِعْرٌ</span> <i>It is exceedingly cheap.</i> (Msb.)

